---
title: "agy acp channel session: one terminal post per person input"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Restart
    lg1: Process
    lg2: Turn
    lg3: Session
    lg4: Breaks AtMostOnePost or NoDuplicateExecution or NoForeignResponse or NoPromptToClearedSession or NoReviveAfterClear in some cases
    lg5: Path to the AtMostOnePost or NoDuplicateExecution or NoForeignResponse or NoPromptToClearedSession or NoReviveAfterClear bug
  }
  class lg0 pink
  class lg1 tan
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 teal
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: No agy child
  s1: Child up, no session
  s2: Session idle
  s3: Input accepted, prompt not yet written
  s4: Prompt open
  s5: AgentDesk restarting
  s6: Old child orphaned, sweep pending
  s7: Turn answered, post pending
  s8: Session loading (replay)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a person sends a message or bridge looks up the receipt, posts the turn's one terminal message and commits
  s0 --> s1: AgentDesk starts agy acp
  s1 --> s2: session/new or agy refuses the stored id#59; session/new
  s2 --> s3: actor accepts the next input (new turn, or steer while a prompt is open)
  s3 --> s3: the input's origin is written ahead into the turn's inflight row or person runs /clear
  s3 --> s4: session/prompt for the saved input (dropped as a failed steer if its turn is stopping)
  s3 --> s5: AgentDesk restarts
  s4 --> s5: AgentDesk restarts
  s5 --> s6: boot settles orphaned prompts
  s4 --> s0: agy exits#59; stdout EOF fails open prompts or deadline passes#59; the child's own process group killed
  s6 --> s0: boot kills the old child's process group
  s1 --> s7: agy refuses the stored id#59; session/new
  s7 --> s3: actor accepts the next input (new turn, or steer while a prompt is open)
  s1 --> s8: reattach the stored id (resume, or load)
  s8 --> s8: load replays an old answer
  s4 --> s7: late response from the killed child
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 blue
  class s4 mayBreak
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 pink
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 tan
  class s6 mayBreak
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 teal
  class s7 mayBreak
  class s7 bugPath
  class s8 teal
  class s8 mayBreak
  class s8 bugPath
